Scope note

This license covers the MACE source code, the MACE-Bench task definitions,
patches, probes and documentation authored in this repository.  It does not
cover the upstream projects that MACE-Bench tasks are derived from: those
projects remain under their own licenses, listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.
The repository does not redistribute upstream source trees or sdists; it pins
their sdists by URL and SHA-256 and downloads them on demand. It does ship one
original and one patched copy of the single file each task targets, under
`.../evidence/<task>/`; those files remain under the upstream license and are
covered by the notices listed in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.
